<title>BRAZIL: Sao Paulo power firms change home page address.</title>
<headline>Sao Paulo power firms change home page address.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sao Paulo state Energy Department said it has changed its internet home page address in which it provides information about power companies under its privatization program.</p>
<p>The new address is http://www.energia.sp.gov.br, it said.</p>
<p>It said the page provides information about power companies Companhia Energetica de Sao Paulo SA, Companhia Paulista de Forca e Luz SA, Eletropaulo and gas distributor Comgas.</p>
<p>((-- Romina Nicaretta, Sao Paulo newsroom, 5511 248 5415))</p>
